{
    "title": "Dream Wedding: Dress & Impress",
    "description": "Dive into 'Dream Wedding!', your ultimate wedding planning adventure. Here, you get to pick every detail for your special day while walking down the aisle.\r\n\r\nStart with choosing the bride's dress and the wedding theme. Opt for a classic look or dare to be different. Your choices in menu, entertainment, and decorations will set the stage for an unforgettable event.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nCustomizable Weddings: Select the dress, theme, furniture music, the cake and all the details. Dress to impress everyone.\r\nInteractive Choices: Make instant decisions that shape your big day.\r\nMemorable Moments: Create a wedding that's truly yours.\r\nDesign Your House: Earn money by designing weddings and spend it to decorate your house and your garden\r\n\r\nAs you make decisions, watch your wedding come to life. From the elegant reception hall to the lively dance floor, every detail contributes to your dream day.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the process of bringing your vision to life, styling everything from outfits to the overall theme. Take charge and plan a wedding that will be remembered forever!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into &#39;Dream Wedding!&#39;, your ultimate wedding planning adventure. Here, you get to pick every detail for your special day while walking down the aisle.<br><br>Start with choosing the bride&#39;s dress and the wedding theme. Opt for a classic look or dare to be different. Your choices in menu, entertainment, and decorations will set the stage for an unforgettable event.<br><br>Features:<br>Customizable Weddings: Select the dress, theme, furniture music, the cake and all the details. Dress to impress everyone.<br>Interactive Choices: Make instant decisions that shape your big day.<br>Memorable Moments: Create a wedding that&#39;s truly yours.<br>Design Your House: Earn money by designing weddings and spend it to decorate your house and your garden<br><br>As you make decisions, watch your wedding come to life. From the elegant reception hall to the lively dance floor, every detail contributes to your dream day.<br><br>Enjoy the process of bringing your vision to life, styling everything from outfits to the overall theme. Take charge and plan a wedding that will be remembered forever!",
